<title>MALAYSIA: BerjayaGroup, Capital suspended.</title>
<headline>BerjayaGroup, Capital suspended.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in the shares of Malaysia's Berjaya Group Bhd and Berjaya Capital Bhd were suspended on the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange on Thursday at the companies' request, an official at the exchange said.</p>
<p>The shares were suspended pending announcements by the companies, the official said.</p>
<p>The companies were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
